{"pageid":3407,"title":"Vampire","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Vampire</span>","revid":19398,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-Character\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Vampire</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Halloween24.png/revision/latest?cb=20241011005928\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Halloween24\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Halloween24.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241011005928\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Halloween24.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241011005928 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d1/Halloween24.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241011005928 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Halloween24\" width=\"270\" height=\"139\" data-image-key=\"Halloween24.png\" data-image-name=\"Halloween24.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t<figcaption class=\"pi-item-spacing pi-caption\">Vampire in-game</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"appearsin\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Appears in</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Blood Moons</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\nThe <b>Vampire</b> is an enemy added in the Halloween 2024 update. The <b>Vampire</b> can appear during a <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Moon\" title=\"Blood Moon\">Blood Moon</a>, which last 5 in-game hours or 5 minutes in real life. When killed, it drops 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Bone\" title=\"Bone\">Bone</a>, 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>, and a Meat Vinyl Player.  \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>It can spawn in the center of the Farlands (near the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>), the Taiga (behind <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's Autologistics</a>) and in the Savannah.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903150156\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 61/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 82/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.928      1 Template:Character\n100.00%    9.928      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3407-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903150156 and revision id 19398. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Characters"],"links":[{"title":"Alan's AutoLogistics","exists":true},{"title":"Blood Moon","exists":true},{"title":"Bone","exists":true},{"title":"Candycorn","exists":true},{"title":"Lighthouse","exists":true}],"images":["Halloween24.png"]}
